p.
</li><li> CFM (constraint force mixing) framework.
</li><li> New testing code.
</li><li> New demo - buggy that you can drive around.
</li><li> Cygwin (GNU on windows) builds now supported.
</li></ul><p></p><p>
</p><h2><a name=3D"ref4">1.3. New in the 0.02 release</a></h2>
